 *
 * Subscribers panel — shared by the setup wizard (step 2) and the Settings
 * page (Subscribers tab). The Settings context adds the master sync toggle
 * the wizard implies. The contacts import (backfill) lives here on both
 * surfaces; behavior lives in panel/panels-js.phtml.
 *
 * @var \Magento\Backend\Block\Template $block
 * @var \Magento\Framework\Escaper $escaper
